    "body": "## Parent\n\n#172\n\n## What to build\n\nRun and close every API, persistence, migration, provider-conformance, LLM-contract, browser, accessibility, typecheck, repository, production-image, boot, and health gate required by the specification.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] All granular assembled-API Task, Action Item, Debrief, connector, Daily Briefing, and Weekly Briefing behaviors pass.\n- [ ] Persistence atomicity, corruption handling, restart behavior, and every legacy migration fixture pass.\n- [ ] The shared connector conformance suite passes for Google Tasks and Asana.\n- [ ] Weekly Summary input exclusion, output validation, fingerprint, quiet-period, failure, consent, and email tests pass without live model spend.\n- [ ] Targeted browser journeys, accessibility checks, and narrow-viewport checks pass.\n- [ ] `npm run typecheck`, `npm run check`, and `npm run check:all` are green.\n- [ ] The production image builds, boots, and passes `/api/health`.\n- [ ] The Debrief Prompt Eval runs only if its prompt, Result Shape, or Goldens changed.\n- [ ] A final spec-to-diff audit finds no omitted or out-of-scope behavior.\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- #200 — Compose the five product areas and Task runtimes in production",
